        {
          "question": "The component renders with no background or the wrong colors.",
          "answer": "Colors use the standard shadcn/ui tokens only (background, foreground, primary, secondary, muted, accent, border, input, ring, destructive), so a project set up with shadcn/ui needs nothing extra and the component follows its theme, dark mode included. Without shadcn/ui, define those CSS variables for :root and .dark and map them in your Tailwind v4 @theme, or run npx shadcn init."
        }
